				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "40000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "Future control functions (not yet designed):\n  - Filament supply on/off relay drive + panel LED\n  - HV supply on/off relay drive + panel LED\n  - T/R relay drive to protect receiver during TX\n  - Additional front-panel indicators / interlocks"
